OpenStax's source MathML for the summation exercise omits the summation
operator itself (an empty <mrow/> where <mo>∑</mo> belongs, in both the
presentation and content MathML), so the operator is restored here.

The converted source also starts two logarithmic series at n=1 even though
their first terms are undefined; they are changed to start at n=2. Further
corrections restore the intended grouping in sin(n+6), repair malformed
subscripts and powers, use proper operator notation, move sentence
punctuation outside math mode, repair the h(d) subpart, and normalize local
LaTeX and unit typography.

